  "summary": {
    "text": "Command Light is the smaller variant of Cohere's Command, a text-only language model with a 4k-token context that Cohere describes as faster and almost as capable. It first appeared on 17 January 2023 as the medium size of the nightly Command builds, took the name command-light in April 2023, was offered on the Cohere API, Amazon Bedrock and Oracle OCI, and was deprecated on 15 September 2025.",
